{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜中九龍繞道九龍灣段開通詳情／冬日小鎮銅鑼灣亮燈\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261127.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】土木工程拓展署聯同運輸署及警方今日(11月27日)介紹中九龍繞道九龍灣段開通詳情。另外，香港繽紛冬日巡禮之冬日小鎮銅鑼灣亮燈，並有光影表演。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.876355+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:23:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:37:48.144501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:52.573773+00:00","content_hash":"e7acac4aada6e777d11b2989939121ca57d1ab56e6c3cbe918ff94dbcffa1847","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}